<header class="rm-head"><div><h1>Usage and add more</h1><p>Your AI credits and sent-email allowance, in one place.</p></div><a class="btn" href="/pricing">Upgrade your plan</a></header>
<div class="usage-pack-grid">
<% for(const meter of summary.meters.filter(m=>['ai_work_credits','emails_sent'].includes(m.meter))){const choices=packs.filter(p=>p.category===meter.meter),unlimited=meter.remaining===null; %>
<section class="card card-body" data-usage-category="<%= meter.meter %>">
<h2><%= meter.meter==='ai_work_credits'?'AI credits':'Emails sent' %></h2><p><strong><%= unlimited?'Unlimited':Number(meter.remaining||0).toLocaleString() %></strong><%= unlimited?' on your current terms':' remaining' %></p>
<% if(unlimited){ %><p>Your current plan has no separate limit for <%= meter.meter==='ai_work_credits'?'AI credits':'emails' %>. Additional packs are not needed.</p><% }else{ %>
<p><%= Number(meter.includedUsed||0).toLocaleString() %> of <%= Number(meter.included||0).toLocaleString() %> included used<%= meter.reserved?' · '+Number(meter.reserved).toLocaleString()+' in progress':'' %></p>
<% if(Number(meter.included)>0&&Number(meter.includedUsed)>=Number(meter.included)*.8){ %><p class="notice notice--warn" role="status"><%= Number(meter.remaining)<=0?'You have used the available allowance. Add a pack or upgrade to continue.':'You have used at least 80% of your included allowance.' %></p><% } %>
<% if(choices.some(pack=>pack.termsReviewRequired)){ %><p class="notice"><span>Your saved plan uses an earlier AI credit definition. <a href="/billing/terms">Review the updated terms</a> before buying a new AI pack. Your current allowance stays unchanged until you approve a change.</span></p><% } %>
<% for(const pack of choices){ %><form method="post" action="/billing/buy-more"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="purchaseKey" value="<%= purchaseKey+':'+pack.id %>"><input type="hidden" name="packId" value="<%= pack.id %>"><button class="btn" data-usage-pack="<%= pack.id %>" <%= checkoutOpen&&pack.purchasable?'':'disabled' %>>Add <%= Number(pack.units).toLocaleString() %> <%= meter.meter==='ai_work_credits'?'AI credits':'emails' %> · <%= new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US',{style:'currency',currency:pack.currency}).format(Number(pack.amount_minor)/100) %></button></form><% } %>
<% if(!checkoutOpen){ %><p>Pack purchases are unavailable on this installation. Your current allowance and saved work are preserved.</p><% }else if(choices.some(pack=>!pack.purchasable&&!pack.termsReviewRequired)){ %><p>A pack is temporarily unavailable while its billing configuration is checked. Your remaining allowance is unchanged; you can also review the plans above.</p><% } %>
<% } %></section><% } %></div><p>Purchases are charged only after you confirm in secure checkout. A pack becomes available after payment is verified. Automatic top-up remains off unless you enable it.</p><a class="btn" href="/settings/billing">Billing history and automatic top-up settings</a>

<section class="card card-body"><h2>AI credits by action</h2><p>Recent credit charges for this inventory. A complex action can have several steps; each charged step is listed. Failed report builds are refunded.</p><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>When</th><th>Action</th><th>Credits used</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><% for(const a of locals.aiActions||[]){ %><tr><td><%= helpers.dateTime(a.occurred_at) %></td><td><%= a.failed_report==='true'?'Report build':a.operation==='import_mapping'?'Read import file':a.operation==='instruction'?'Prepare instruction':'AI question or action' %></td><td><%= a.status==='COMMITTED'?Number(a.units).toLocaleString():'0' %></td><td><%= a.status==='REVERSED'?'Not charged / refunded':a.status==='RESERVED'?'In progress': 'Completed' %></td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></section>
